{"script":"m_0_1_5","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1.15,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":291,"transTime":300,"y":-267.9999999999999,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.15,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]呜哇啊啊啊啊啊——！[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"米托拉，你声音也太大了……","tag":"tag_4"},{"text":"也用不着这么夸张……","tag":"tag_4"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"_root","y":0,"d":0.8,"x":10},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show][cm]太了不起了吧！看看这个营地！你真的能行！[r][l]和之前那个垃圾场一样的废墟，简直不敢相信是同一个地方！[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"这都是这把锤子的功劳……","tag":"tag_20"},{"text":"看来我还记得如何使用它……","tag":"tag_20"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.15,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":291,"transTime":300,"y":-267.9999999999999,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.15,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]是什么都好啦！工具只有在对的人手里才有用！能使用这玩意的你，可比这东西本身厉害多了！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]虽、虽然很不想承认……这比我之前盖得好多了！[r][l]你这家伙……你这家伙何止不是什么没用的累赘，简直就是宝藏！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]本来我还准备等你伤好了，就把你交给驿站那帮人的……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]干脆从现在开始就由我来罩着你吧！之前的救命之恩就一笔勾销怎么样！[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"这点小事不算什么。","tag":"tag_22"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show][cm]怎么能说是小事……！这个营地……这个营地是我的心血。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]这两年来……我一直都住在这里，它就是我的家，我的宝物！我真不知道该怎么——[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"（看来米托拉真的很珍视这座营地……）","tag":"tag_24"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show][cm]（咕噜噜噜～）[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]呃……哈哈……今天确实还没吃什么东西……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊，说来我的储备粮也全被角布林给糟蹋了！[r][l]现在营地里什么也不剩了，那些可恶的混蛋——！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唉……？你说你也饿了……不然去收集一些食材，你还能帮着……“烹饪”？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"x":0,"y":10,"d":0.8,"layer":"chara2"},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]好啊好啊！你还有这种手艺吗！太了不起了吧？[r]找不到人换食物的时候，我都是直接啃生肉的！[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"虽然记不太清，但我觉得我会做些料理。","tag":"tag_28"},{"text":"不管怎么说，直接啃生肉也……","tag":"tag_28"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show][cm]好啦——！不是说这些的时候！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我知道一个食材非常充足的地方！虽然路上有点危险，但有我罩着你，绝对没事的啦！[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para"